<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="Hi, I'm Dhanush Kovi (dkvc)! Currently engaging with AI, Quantum Computing and Web Development. Check out my site!" />
    <title>Dhanush Kovi | dkvc</title>
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        color: #000;
        background: #fff;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #000; outline-offset: 2px; }

      .container {
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 64px 24px;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        border: 1px solid #000;
        padding: 4px 12px;
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 48px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .tagline {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #555;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 15px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .links {
        margin-top: 40px;
        padding-top: 32px;
        border-top: 1px solid #000;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 400;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .links-list {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 4px;
      }

      .links-list li + li::before {
        content: "/";
        padding: 0 12px;
        color: #888;
      }

      .links-list a {
        color: #000;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .links-list a:hover {
        color: #666;
      }

      .footer {
        margin-top: 32px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888;
      }

      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .container { padding: 48px 20px; }
        h1 { font-size: 24px; }
        .links-list { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
        .links-list li + li::before { display: none; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="container">
      <div class="badge">Under Renovation - v3</div>

      <h1>Dhanush Kovi</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Currently engaging with AI, Quantum Computing and Web Development</p>

      <p>Thank you for checking out my site!</p>
      <p>
        I'm Dhanush Kovi (or dkvc). My work centers on developing and optimizing systems,
        such as complex AI models or crafting fluid web experiences. Recently, I've also
        started looking into the field of Quantum Computing.
      </p>

      <nav class="links">
        <h2>You can also find me on</h2>
        <ul class="links-list">
          <li><a href="mailto:dhanush@dkvc.org">Email</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/dkvc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://gitlab.com/dkvc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitLab</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/dkvc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://infosec.exchange/@dkvc" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer">Mastodon</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <footer class="footer">Last updated: {{BUILD_DATE}}</footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
